/* DeckLinkAPI_i.c — GUID definitions for the DeckLink C++ SDK (compiled as C).
 *
 * The vendored DeckLinkAPI_h.h (MIDL output) only *declares* the interface
 * IIDs and CoCreateable CLSIDs (EXTERN_C const ...); the values normally live
 * in the MIDL-generated DeckLinkAPI_i.c. This file is that TU: with <initguid.h>
 * up front, each DEFINE_GUID below emits a definition. Interface UUID strings
 * are taken from the MIDL_INTERFACE("...") attributes in DeckLinkAPI_h.h; the
 * iterator CLSID matches the value ffmpeg's decklink WIDL header uses.
 */

